{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09510","headline":"元次山居武昌之樊山新春大雪以诗问之 · 孟彦深","name":"元次山居武昌之樊山新春大雪以诗问之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江山十日雪，雪深江雾浓。\n起来望樊山，但见羣玉峰。\n林莺却不语，野兽翻有踪。\n山中应大寒，短褐何以完。\n皓气凝书帐，清着钓鱼竿。\n怀君欲进谒，谿滑渡舟难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟彦深","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}